    add 1 "The Agent of Mystery - Earth" from your Deck or GY to your hand instead.
    You can Tribute 1 Fairy monster, then target 1 card your opponent controls; destroy
    it. You can only use each effect of "Protector of The Agents - Moon" once per
    turn.'
